<title>NETHERLANDS: Ten Cate 1996 normal net up rises.</title>
<headline>Ten Cate 1996 normal net up rises.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net from ordinary ops     32.1  vs  26.8</p>
<p>    Total net per share (guilders)   7.03 vs   4.87</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    30.2  vs  20.5</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.42 vs   1.34</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    79.4  vs  59.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected textiles and plastics firm Koninklijke Ten Cate NV to report a 1996 net profit from ordinary operations of 28 million to 38 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.00 vs   2.40</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    26.5  vs  26.4</p>
<p>    Tax				     20.3  vs  10.2</p>
<p>    Associates' income	   loss  0.5  vs   3.8 gain</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 5.5  vs   7.0</p>
<p>    Minorities gain			3.6  vs   0.7</p>
<p>    Net/shr from ordinary ops (gldr) 8.31 vs   6.53</p>
<p>    Cashflow per share (guilders)   23.15 vs  20.70</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
